  "id": "a947cd21-700b-4491-8d0b-de4ab7239a73",
  "title": "Unified 3D Semantic Editing Frameworks",
  "summary": "ChromaGS enables real-time, language-guided color editing of 4D Gaussian avatars using semantic regions, while ManifoldSplat provides end-to-end language-guided shape editing for animatable 3D Gaussian avatars. Both approaches aim to achieve precise, localized control across different aspects of 3D editing.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "ChromaGS provides deterministic, precisely localized semantic control over Gaussian avatars with text-guided color editing.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "ManifoldSplat introduces a structured FLAME manifold for end-toend semantic shape editing with improved geometric consistency and identity preservation.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "ChromaGS and ManifoldSplat both use a language pipeline to translate text instructions into target colors or shape deltas.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
  ],
